       <div type="translation" resp="part:kuch">
 	<p n="1-3">Wealth which consisted of slaves <supplied reason="subaudible">for</supplied> V.K.A. Śrī Vr̥ṣabhadhvajeśvara: <gap reason="lost"/> <foreign>ku</foreign> Vraḥ Kañje, two children, <gap reason="lost"/>, three children, <foreign>ku</foreign> Mandodarī, one child, <foreign>ku</foreign> Ratnaśrīya, <foreign>ku</foreign> Mallavikā, <foreign>ku</foreign> Sanidha, <foreign>ku</foreign> <gap reason="lost"/>, <foreign>ku</foreign> Agat, <foreign>ku</foreign> Juṅ, <foreign>ku</foreign> Kañjoṅ, <foreign>ku</foreign> Tvās.</p>
